      <li><a href="#physics-of-rotation">1. Physics of Axial Rotation (360° / 24h = 15°/h)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#prime-meridian-greenwich">2. The Prime Meridian &amp; Royal Observatory Greenwich</a></li>
      <li><a href="#solar-time-vs-civil-time">3. Solar Noon vs. Civil Clock Time</a></li>
      <li><a href="#utc-offset-continuum">4. The Global UTC Offset Continuum (-12 to +14)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#fractional-half-hour-zones">5. Fractional &amp; Half-Hour Time Zones</a></li>
      <li><a href="#political-distortions">6. Political Boundary Distortions (China Single Zone)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#iana-database-architecture">7. IANA Time Zone Database (`tzdb`) Architecture</a></li>
